\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Father, in whom we live, 
\par In whom we are, and move,
\par The glory, power, and praise receive
\par Of Thy creating love.
\par Let all the angel throng
\par Give thanks to God on high;
\par While earth repeats the joyful song,
\par And echoes to the sky.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Incarnate Deity, 
\par Let all the ransomed race
\par Render in thanks their lives to Thee
\par For Thy redeeming grace
\par The grace to sinners showed
\par Ye heavenly choirs proclaim, 
\par And cry: salvation to our God,
\par Salvation to the Lamb!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Spirit of Holiness,
\par Let all Thy saints adore
\par Thy sacred energy, and bless
\par Thine heart-renewing power
\par Not angel tongues can tell
\par Thy love's ecstatic height, 
\par The gracious joy unspeakable, 
\par The beatific sight. 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Eternal, Triune Lord!
\par Let all the hosts above,
\par Let all the sons of men, record 
\par And dwell upon Thy love
\par When heaven and earth are fled
\par Before Thy gracious face
\par Sing all the saints Thy love hath made
\par Thine everlasting praise.
\par                          Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

